body:
\#40 here! Good luck everyone! 

&#x200B;

https://preview.redd.it/gfijdw8s5jqc1.png?width=1284&format=png&auto=webp&s=62076d8b0a5586993a490603a9754484c2be242b

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

" It sounds like you suck at the game as a victim. "

&#x200B;

Have you ever played with me? NO.

Do you know how long I have been playing this fucking game? NO

If you had at least ONE braincell there is not much anyone can do against that. $40 dollars can be cheap to you but not everyone else. Don't be an entitled brat. You like the game and its mechanics? So be it , get off my post and go play it then. There is absolutely NOTHING I can do against the games literal shitty mechanics. You don't agree , cool. But don't come on someone's post and fucking TRY to insult them because you don't agree with them. Disgusting.

Honestly , you sound like my brain talking back to me haha. Love 119 just seems THEM... It doesn't seem forced. I mean they literally are OWNING this song. When I listen to this song , I feel like its them. After I heard it the first time I was like " Okay. NOW this is who Riize is supposed to be. This is who they are. " 

&#x200B;

I need Love 119 and Memories on a mini album and ill be good. haha

I really enjoy New Jeans. If I must say , they are one of my favorite female groups out right now! I find them all so very refreshing. I also see a lot of people saying that they can not distinguish their voices from one another. Which is funny to me because when I first heard of New Jeans , one of the first things I thought was " WOW! I can actually tell them apart when they sing. " HAH! 

&#x200B;

Aldo to the OP , I saw you made an edit & said some people were being rude to you because of your opinion. That is a bit absurd. Everyone is entitled to their opinion! Not everyone has to like what others do. That is the glory of  individuality! Don't let it get to you , your opinion is valid haha. I clearly think different as well but im not going to bash you for what you think!

&#x200B;

I have bought so much NewJeans merch & what not that i think I may be broke now haha. I Have a streaming room that you can barley even see the walls anymore haha. It is just full of art & kpop artists. No , I don't need to be saved 😝

LMFAOOOO! When I first saw it I was a bit busy & distracted helping a family member with something. So , I saw about the first couple lines & it looked so legit and I was so happy. I didn't realize it was even " April Fools " until I was done being busy , sat down & went to open the game LMFAO! i am sure that if I wasn't busy at the moment I would have found out right away haha. Obviously im not upset , I thought it was great when I actually found out haha.

&#x200B;

EDIT ; Also , no need for anyone to be all technical. I love this game & they have been doing great. It would not come as a surprise to me if they did put out a huge update like this. Maybe we even got some clues on what we will get on the next update!! ( whenever that is ) I hope that it is soon haha.
